    "title": "Large dog adoption fees waived this weekend at Massachusetts shelters - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Beck Wehner ,\n7 hours ago SPRINGFIELD, Mass. (WWLP) – Local animal welfare organizations are waiving adoption fees this weekend for all dogs weighing at least 40 pounds. The fee-waived pop-up event applies to larger dogs and puppies across four MSPCA-Angell locations and three partner shelters. The initiative comes one week after a nor’easter disrupted... Read full article\n13",
